## Single Caret Handoff Contract

When a rich Markdown payload spans paragraphs, lists, and code blocks:
**Multiple blinking carets are strictly forbidden!**
As downstream parts take over generation, upstream parts instantly retract their caret. When the answer completes, the final caret gently dissolves.
